# Unused prefixes

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . # kept: it has a comment
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# --- vocabularies for later ---

@prefix dct: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

ex:alice rdf:type foaf:Person ; foaf:age "42"^^xsd:integer ;
  foaf:knows <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/bob> .

@prefix later: <http://example.org/later#> .
@prefix unused: <http://example.org/unused#> .

later:thing ex:p ex:o .
